        "client_msg_id": "726037b5-eca3-4c14-bf63-1f1a722ff6ec",
        "text": "Cool! I haven't been following LLM APIs recently so maybe you'll know... Is there a way to make them ingest/produce embeddings for graph vertices or edges? IIRC just before LLM explosion transformers were making some noise because of their ability to process graph-shaped data natively.",
        "team": "T5TCAFTA9",
        "thread_ts": "1748503588.933639",
        "parent_user_id": "U0123H7JRDM",
        "blocks": [
            {
                "type": "rich_text",
