        "client_msg_id": "7827288e-b6b5-4352-9297-bb2abb4ecc62",
        "text": "I'm asking because I see them being used to process tons of JSON data and it feels a little weird to make graphs go through text representation (maybe it helps with something but also seems pretty inefficient)",
