        "client_msg_id": "9450e9ba-d955-4f62-bf26-016a70cf434e",
        "text": "You can create graphs with llm's, thats what I do using that small generator.. but the layout is done without llms in that generator .. I am experimenting with different libraries like cytoscape and d3 forced layout.",
